# Files we made ourselves that tools/check_clean.py mistakes for game files: one path per line, from the repo root.
# Every path here skips all of check_clean's checks, so keep the list short and say why each one is safe.

# Made-up functions in the exact shape of Savage Wind's generator output (that is the point: build_native.py selftest
# runs gen_hooks.py on them and builds a fake game library to test modhost's hooks without the game). Not game code:
# seven functions with invented addresses and bodies (main_000.c and main_001.c say so in a comment; main_table.c is
# just their address table).
native/modhost/selftest/hooked/main_000.c
native/modhost/selftest/hooked/main_001.c
native/modhost/selftest/hooked/main_table.c
